              <li><a href="#hambatan-umum" class="hover:text-tc-accent transition-colors">5. Apa Hambatan Umum yang Dialami Anak RPL Saat PKL?</a></li>
              <li><a href="#faq-section" class="hover:text-tc-accent transition-colors">6. FAQ Anak RPL PKL Ngapain Aja</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-tc-muted text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
